augments the immersiveness and make you feel like you're right in the scene.\n\n- **Personalized Feed Tailored to Your Interest**\n\nPhoton learns what you love as you explore. Also, try the search feature to discover your favorite video theme in immersive 3D", "short_description": "Photon: Explore Immersive Media.\n\nDiscover immersive 3D video experiences with Photon.\n\nWith 100,000+ immersive videos, Photon is a leading platform for immersive media discovery and sharing.\n\nFrom traveling the world to dancing on stage, from breathtaking nature to city skylines \u2014 everything you can and can\u2019t imagine is here."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://interdime.io/privacy_policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Photon XR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://photon-xr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26813288338280914"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_2809824516037002_3187250038504653379_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xZEOnEaATccQ7kNvwGCNBDm&_nc_oc=Ado6bec30jN9YB2_cYI2fOfpdjP6wCCaAnYhSsB2UN7YvPBbMeACVT_FFrLB3Hda8JE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af